<Legal
  title="Refund Policy"
  description="How cancellations and refunds work on Porphyra's Pro plan."
  lastUpdated="2026-08-07"
>
  <p>
    Cancel your Pro subscription any time from account settings — you keep access through
    the end of the period you already paid for, then it drops to Free. No cancellation fee,
    no retention call.
  </p>

  <h2>Refunds</h2>
  <p>
    First subscription payment: full refund within 14 days of charge if you're not satisfied,
    no questions asked — email
    <a href="mailto:hello@porphyra.example">hello@porphyra.example</a>. Renewal payments
    after the first 14 days aren't refunded for partial periods, since cancelling stops
    future charges immediately; you keep what you already paid for through the period's end.
  </p>

  <h2>Billing errors</h2>
  <p>
    Charged in error, or after you'd already cancelled? Email us — we refund billing
    mistakes in full, no time limit.
  </p>

  <h2>Where required by law</h2>
  <p>
    If your jurisdiction gives you stronger statutory refund or cooling-off rights than
    what's above, those rights apply regardless of this policy.
  </p>
</Legal>
